# ── Site assistant (/api/chat) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev: copy this file to ".env" and paste your key after the "=".
# Production: set the same variable in your Vercel project settings.
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# No VITE_ prefix on purpose — that would ship the key to the browser.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-3.5-flash-lite (what Google opens to new keys;
# gemini-2.5-flash free tier is ~20 req/day and burns out quickly in local dev).
# GEMINI_MODEL=
